# 42. 401 vs 403

Very common exam question.

### 401

The request lacks valid authentication credentials or authentication is required.

### 403

The server understands the request but refuses to authorize it.

### Memory

> **401 = Who are you?**

> **403 = I know you, but you're not allowed.**

